1
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:19,720
Liu Yiyang,

2
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:22,160
you idiot.

3
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:26,960
Warning.

4
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:29,840
Extremely strong negative
emotions detected.

5
00:00:29,920 --> 00:00:33,240
Administrator Liu Yiyang
has been notified to execute the purge.

6
00:00:33,240 --> 00:00:34,440
Do not resist.

7
00:00:41,480 --> 00:00:42,160
Warning.

8
00:00:42,360 --> 00:00:45,040
Extremely strong negative
emotions detected.

9
00:00:45,120 --> 00:00:48,440
Administrator Liu Yiyang
has been notified to execute the purge.

10
00:00:48,440 --> 00:00:49,640
Do not resist.

11
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:03,400
You're awake.

12
00:01:03,840 --> 00:01:04,440
Sleepwalking in the middle of the night

13
00:01:04,440 --> 00:01:06,200
isn't a good habit.

14
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:07,040
Dr. Xiao,

15
00:01:07,440 --> 00:01:09,160
everyone's been too tense lately.

16
00:01:09,160 --> 00:01:11,280
How about we go to the park
outside the city tomorrow to relax?

17
00:01:11,280 --> 00:01:13,000
Relax, it's safe here.

18
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:19,400
You're crushing that can too hard.

19
00:01:21,039 --> 00:01:23,840
Are you transferring the pain
to your hands

20
00:01:25,320 --> 00:01:27,640
to force a smile?

21
00:01:30,240 --> 00:01:31,640
You're overthinking it.

22
00:01:31,800 --> 00:01:34,000
My hand just cramped up.

23
00:01:34,160 --> 00:01:38,640
Liu Yiyang, do you know
what an emotion purge is?

24
00:01:43,320 --> 00:01:45,120
You're under too much stress lately,

25
00:01:45,120 --> 00:01:46,640
saying things I don't understand.

26
00:01:46,640 --> 00:01:48,360
Listen to me, what you need most right now

27
00:01:48,360 --> 00:01:49,720
is a good night's sleep.

28
00:02:31,640 --> 00:02:33,360
Han, something happened.

29
00:02:33,360 --> 00:02:35,720
Qiqi has been smiling since last night,

30
00:02:35,720 --> 00:02:37,480
like a soulless mannequin.

31
00:02:37,520 --> 00:02:38,880
Go check on her.

32
00:02:44,440 --> 00:02:44,840
Han,

33
00:02:45,360 --> 00:02:47,040
the weather is so nice today.

34
00:02:50,600 --> 00:02:52,060
What happened last night?

35
00:02:52,200 --> 00:02:53,800
Last night, she suddenly asked me

36
00:02:53,800 --> 00:02:55,600
if this world was real or fake.

37
00:02:55,600 --> 00:02:57,320
She cried and said she missed home.

38
00:02:57,320 --> 00:02:59,079
I didn't know how to comfort her,

39
00:02:59,079 --> 00:03:01,000
so I went to buy her some food.

40
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:03,920
But when I came back,
she was already like this.

41
00:03:19,840 --> 00:03:21,840
Han, don't scare me.

42
00:03:22,120 --> 00:03:22,960
Look at me.

43
00:03:23,760 --> 00:03:24,640
Smile.

44
00:03:25,640 --> 00:03:26,600
I can't smile.

45
00:03:26,600 --> 00:03:27,960
Han, I'm scared.

46
00:03:28,040 --> 00:03:29,800
I really can't smile.

47
00:03:34,440 --> 00:03:36,040
You don't want to be purged, do you?

48
00:03:36,040 --> 00:03:36,840
Smile.

49
00:03:37,280 --> 00:03:39,120
Only if we stay awake

50
00:03:39,440 --> 00:03:40,960
can we save Qiqi.

51
00:04:06,240 --> 00:04:07,440
Liu Yiyang,

52
00:04:07,440 --> 00:04:08,770
no matter what happens,

53
00:04:09,320 --> 00:04:10,920
I won't let you bear it alone.

54
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:02,840
You're finally here.

55
00:05:04,200 --> 00:05:05,160
Who are you?

56
00:05:06,280 --> 00:05:07,400
I'm Shen Lan,

57
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:10,640
the former administrator of the Shepherd.

58
00:05:10,640 --> 00:05:11,640
Former?

59
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:15,420
So you're the one who hurt Liu Yiyang.

60
00:05:16,640 --> 00:05:18,000
It wasn't me,

61
00:05:18,840 --> 00:05:20,040
it was this world.

62
00:05:23,840 --> 00:05:25,360
From the very beginning,

63
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:27,360
we were just fuel for this world,

64
00:05:27,880 --> 00:05:29,360
carriers of emotion.

65
00:05:31,480 --> 00:05:34,280
The Shepherd runs by
extracting extreme emotions.

66
00:05:34,280 --> 00:05:35,240
What do you mean?

67
00:05:35,240 --> 00:05:36,960
Whoever has the strongest emotions

68
00:05:36,960 --> 00:05:38,680
is chosen as the carrier.

69
00:05:39,040 --> 00:05:41,040
But human emotions have limits.

70
00:05:41,040 --> 00:05:42,960
Once love, hate, joy,
and sorrow are drained,

71
00:05:42,960 --> 00:05:44,600
the carrier's life is over.

72
00:05:44,600 --> 00:05:45,880
Just like me now,

73
00:05:46,640 --> 00:05:48,570
my body is slowly disintegrating,

74
00:05:48,840 --> 00:05:51,840
becoming cold data
building materials for this city.

75
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:56,520
How many more days do you think
his life can fuel this world?
